{"2974516290":{"description":"Stitched Panorama"},"2974543790":{"description":"Stitched Panorama"},"4408548690":{"description":"<a href=\"http://bighugelabs.com/onblack.php?id=4408548690&amp;size=large\" rel=\"nofollow\">On Black</a>. 1039-42.\n\nWinter still have Sweden in a very firm grip. I commute every day to Stockholm from the North Pole (Uppsala). It's a trial. Every day is like a miniature polar expedition with cold, snow, poor road conditions and trains not running or running too late. This image was captured last night (March 4) in a small but anoying snowstorm. Today it's sunny and -10 degrees outside. Where's spring?\n\nStitched Panorama (Autopano Pro, 4 portrait images, hand held, F/1.4, ISO 800, 1/100-1/125 s.)\n\nThis is a image licensed: <a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/deed.en\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Creative Commons: BY</a>. Use the image if you like!"},"4818346990":{"description":"3640."},"5638160590":{"description":"Anatomiska institutionen, Uppsala universitet dokumenterat för projektet &quot;Huvudjägarna, Museum Anatomicum och samlandets sociala dynamik&quot; som är ett FoU-projekt vid Statens historiska museum."},"5670436490":{"description":"11913-16. Stitched Panorama"},"5731036690":{"description":"11987-90. Stitched Panorama"},"5737552890":{"description":"12278"},"6907945990":{"description":"21818","exif":{"focal":"50 mm","aperture":"f/2.0","exposure":"0.001 sec (1/800)","iso":"100"}},"7422199190":{"description":"25685","exif":{"focal":"200 mm","aperture":"f/2.8","exposure":"0.001 sec (1/1250)","iso":"100"}},"7608516990":{"description":"27375","exif":{"focal":"180 mm","aperture":"f/2.8","exposure":"0.002 sec (1/640)","iso":"100"}},"7642459590":{"description":"28037","exif":{"focal":"115 mm","aperture":"f/2.8","exposure":"0.001 sec (1/800)","iso":"100"}},"8130967890":{"description":"32601-02. Stitched Panorama","exif":{"focal":"85 mm","aperture":"f/1.8","exposure":"0.002 sec (1/640)","iso":"100"}},"8145747090":{"description":"